sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant TabA as Browser Tab A
  participant API as Auth API
  participant DB as Refresh Token Store
  participant Socket as Socket.IO
  participant TabB as Browser Tab B

  User->>TabA: Trigger logout-all/password/email/password-reset
  TabA->>API: Auth request
  API->>API: Validate request
  API->>DB: Revoke affected refresh tokens
  DB-->>API: Revocation persisted
  API->>Socket: Emit auth:session-revoked to user room
  Socket-->>TabA: auth:session-revoked
  Socket-->>TabB: auth:session-revoked
  TabA->>TabA: Clear auth state and API cache
  TabB->>TabB: Clear auth state and API cache
  TabA->>TabA: Redirect to /
  TabB->>TabB: Redirect to /
  API-->>TabA: Existing API success response
